## 5. Hardware Emulation and Third-Party Rights

Configuration Files and Derivative Designs may let a Product emulate other
hardware. This Licence grants rights only in the Licensor's own materials.
You are solely responsible for obtaining any rights needed to emulate
hardware, instruction sets, firmware or interfaces owned by others.

