## 6. Distribution and Attribution

**6.1 Distribution.** When You distribute the Licensed Materials or any
Derivative Design, in any form, You shall:

(a) license them only under this Licence, and impose no further restrictions;
(b) keep intact all copyright, mask work, trademark, attribution and licence
    notices, including SPDX identifiers;
(c) include a copy of this Licence;
(d) mark modified files with a prominent notice stating that You changed
    them and the date; and
(e) provide the complete design source of any Derivative Design You
    distribute, in the preferred form for making modifications.

**6.2 Attribution notice.** The "Attribution Notice" is:

> Based on the ZXV hardware designs by Michael Laurence Curzi &
> 36N9 GENETICS LLC, PO Box 6, Calpine, CA 96124-0006, United States,
> deal@zedec.ai. Licensed under the ZXV Hardware License.

The Licensor may update the contact details by publishing a revised notice
in the repository; You shall use the current version for new Products and
new distributions.

**6.3 Attribution is required in every use.** Under both the Open Tier and
the Commercial Licence Agreement, You shall give the Attribution Notice:

(a) in every copy of the Licensed Materials and every Derivative Design You
    distribute, in a NOTICE or README file at the top of the design;
(b) for every Product You make available to others, in its user
    documentation or product information, and on any "About", settings,
    boot or information screen the Product has;
(c) on the Product itself where practical: printed circuit boards shall
    carry a short form ("ZXV design: Curzi / 36N9 GENETICS") on the
    silkscreen, and chassis or packaging shall carry it on a label, unless
    there is no reasonable space; integrated circuits may carry it in the
    package marking or, if not practical, in a readable identification
    register or device information string;
(d) in any publication, paper, presentation or product listing that
    describes work based on the Licensed Materials, as a citation to
    Michael Laurence Curzi & 36N9 GENETICS LLC.

**6.4 No endorsement.** The Attribution Notice credits the origin of the
design only. You shall not state or imply that the Licensor or the
Foundation endorses, warrants or manufactured Your Product unless it holds
the Certification Mark under Section 8.

**6.5 Moral rights.** To the extent the law of any country gives the authors
a right to be identified as authors, they assert it.

