## 7. The Foundation

**7.1 Third-party beneficiary.** The Foundation is an intended third-party
beneficiary of Sections 4.3 to 4.6 and may enforce them directly.

**7.2 No obligations on the Foundation.** The Foundation gives no warranty,
assumes no obligation, and has no liability under this Licence.

**7.3 No control.** Only the Licensor may grant, modify or terminate licences
under this Licence.

**7.4 Successor.** If the Foundation dissolves, loses its nonprofit status,
or cannot accept payments, the Licensor may designate by public notice a
successor organisation exempt under section 501(c)(3) of the U.S. Internal
Revenue Code or its equivalent, and royalties then accruing are payable to it.

