## 8. Certification Mark

**8.1** ZXV CERTIFIED is a certification mark owned by the Foundation. It certifies that a Product (a) was made under a Commercial
Licence Agreement in good standing with royalties paid, and (b) meets the
published ZXV conformance tests.

**8.2** Only Products that meet Section 8.1 may use the Certification Mark,
connect to the Official Services as certified devices, or receive signed
Configuration File updates through the Official Services.

**8.3** This Licence grants no other right to use the names or marks ZXV,
ZEDEC, XERO, VULPINE, GlyphMap, 36N9 GENETICS, ILLUMAHEART, or any other mark
of the Licensor or the Foundation, except to state truthfully that a design
or Product is derived from the ZXV hardware designs.

---

## 9. Termination

**9.1 Non-payment.** If You fail to pay any royalty or deliver any report
when due, and do not cure that failure within 30 days after written notice
from the Licensor or the Foundation, every licence granted to You under this
Licence terminates automatically at the end of that period.

**9.2 Other breach.** If You breach any other term and do not cure within
30 days after written notice, every licence granted to You terminates.

**9.3 Effect.** After termination: (a) any further copying, adaptation or
use of the Licensed Materials, Licensed Mask Works or Configuration Files by
You is unlicensed and infringes the Licensor's rights; (b) You must stop
using the Certification Mark; (c) Your Products lose certified status and
access to the Official Services for units sold after termination; and
(d) unpaid royalties, interest and the Licensor's reasonable collection costs
remain due as a contract debt. The Licensor and the Foundation may pursue
all remedies available at law or in equity.

**9.3A Exemption breach.** A breach of Section 4A.2 is a breach under
Section 9.2, and Section 4A.4 also applies.

**9.4 Reinstatement.** The Licensor may reinstate a terminated licence in
writing once all amounts owed, interest and reasonable enforcement costs are
paid.

**9.5 Survival.** Sections 2, 4.4, 6.3 (for copies and Products already
distributed), 4.5, 7, 9.3, 11, 12 and 14 survive
termination. Royalty-paid Products in the hands of purchasers remain
licensed.

