## 14. General

**14.1 Reservation.** All rights not expressly granted are reserved. No
licence is granted by implication or estoppel.

**14.2 Governing law and venue.** Arizona law and applicable U.S. federal law
govern, without regard to conflict of laws rules. Exclusive venue lies in the
state and federal courts in Maricopa County, Arizona, except that the
Licensor may seek injunctive relief in any competent court.

**14.3 Severability and reformation.** An unenforceable provision shall be
reformed to the minimum extent needed to make it enforceable; the rest stays
in effect. If the royalty in Section 4.3 is unenforceable as applied to any
Product or period, the royalty for it is the highest enforceable royalty.

**14.4 Versions.** The Licensor may publish revised versions. Licensed
Materials remain under the version they were released under unless the
Licensor states otherwise.

**14.5 Entire licence.** This Licence is the entire agreement on its subject
for anyone not party to a separate signed agreement under Section 4.9.

